Subject: [M156] [SkSL:RP] Prevent slot count overflow in Raster Pipeline
 codegen

Original change's description:
> [SkSL:RP] Prevent slot count overflow in Raster Pipeline codegen
>
> Guard SlotManager::createSlots against signed integer overflow using SkSafeMath and SkTFitsIn<int>, and fail codegen if any slot table (program, uniform, or immutable slots) overflows. Also guard temporary stack depth calculations in Program::tempStackMaxDepths and Program::Program against integer overflow and reject negative slot counts in Program::allocateSlotData.
>
